{"t":"Finsterer Altar","p":"Finsterer_Altar","g":"Übersichten","html":"<div><table> <tbody><tr> <td colspan=\"2\"><b>Finsterer Altar</b> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div>Bild</div> </td> <td> <div>Positionen</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p><img alt=\"Finsterer Altar.png\" height=\"279\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/d/d4/Finsterer_Altar.png\" width=\"300\"/> </p> </td> <td> <div> <div>Funktion</div> </div> <div> <ul><li>Durch das Anklicken des Finsterer Altar öffnet sich ein Fenster, in das <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter\">Seelensplitter</a> gezogen werden können, um <a data-w=\"Nykos\">Nykos</a> oder <a data-w=\"Verfluchter_Nykos\">Verfluchter Nykos</a> zu beschwören.<br/><br/></li></ul> <div><div><div><img height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/4/4b/Nykos_Beschw%C3%B6ren.png\" width=\"190\"/> <div>Nykos Beschwörung</div></div></div></div></div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan=\"2\"> <table> <tbody><tr> <td> <div>Quests</div> </td> <td> <div>Sonstige Informationen</div> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <div><i>Dieser NPC wird für keine Quests benötigt.</i></div> </td> <td> <div>Folgende Seelensplitter benötigt man zum Beschwören: <ul><li><span> <span><img alt=\"Seelensplitter (Tod).png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/1/19/Seelensplitter_%28Tod%29.png/22px-Seelensplitter_%28Tod%29.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter_(Tod)\">Seelensplitter (Tod)</a></li> <li><span> <span><img alt=\"Seelensplitter (Ritus).png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/d/d9/Seelensplitter_%28Ritus%29.png/22px-Seelensplitter_%28Ritus%29.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter_(Ritus)\">Seelensplitter (Ritus)</a></li> <li><span> <span><img alt=\"Seelensplitter (Herz).png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/6/60/Seelensplitter_%28Herz%29.png/22px-Seelensplitter_%28Herz%29.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter_(Herz)\">Seelensplitter (Herz)</a></li> <li><span> <span><img alt=\"Seelensplitter (Mond).png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/b/b7/Seelensplitter_%28Mond%29.png/22px-Seelensplitter_%28Mond%29.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter_(Mond)\">Seelensplitter (Mond)</a></li> <li><span> <span><img alt=\"Seelensplitter (Gier).png\" height=\"22\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://de-wiki.metin2.gameforge.com/images/thumb/2/25/Seelensplitter_%28Gier%29.png/22px-Seelensplitter_%28Gier%29.png\" width=\"22\"/></span></span> <a data-w=\"Seelensplitter_(Gier)\">Seelensplitter (Gier)</a></li></ul></div> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </div>"}